<title>USA: Lehman confirms Massport names it lead manger.</title>
<headline>Lehman confirms Massport names it lead manger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers confirmed Thursday it was selected to head a new bond syndicate for Massachusetts Port Authority (Massport).</p>
<p>&quot;I can confirm Lehman will be the lead manager,&quot; a spokesman for Lehman said.</p>
<p>No other information about the syndicate or the debt it will handle was immediately available.</p>
<p>Massport officials were not available to comment as they were in a meeting.</p>
<p>((--Joan Gralla, 212-859-1654))</p>
</text>
